# Keeps the build context small enough to send. node_modules alone is gigabytes and is
# always reinstalled inside the image anyway; target/ likewise for the Maven services.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/build
**/target
**/.next
**/.expo
**/.nx
**/coverage
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
**/*.tsbuildinfo

.git
.github

# Never let a real secrets file reach an image layer. The template is enough.
config/secrets/.env
**/.env.local
**/.env.*.local

# Frontend .env files hold each developer's local API host (localhost, a LAN IP). Vite would bake
# whichever it found into the production bundle. Production values arrive as build args instead.
apps/frontend/*/.env
apps/frontend/*/.env.production

**/*.log
**/.DS_Store
